        {
          "_key": "nzsecdbj",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Let’s say you’re a digital marketer launching a new product. You want to create a short promotional video but don’t have the time to manually edit clips together. You can use Clipfly’s "
        },
        {
          "_key": "af84ylcx",
